o dos meses (MAD escalonado), na escala do gráfico.&#10;Escala logarítmica (asinh) só para exibição, para comparar valores de ordens de grandeza diferentes: o eixo e este texto mostram valores originais; o tracejado marca a mediana dos meses (1,16%).&#10;Gráfico winsorizado a 2,5% de cada lado: meses abaixo de P2,5 (0,19%) ou acima de P97,5 (2,30%) aparecem nesses limites (2 meses); a média e o desvio usam os valores publicados (de 0,13% a 2,31%).&#10;Campo CVM Percentual_Rentabilidade_Efetiva_Mes (tabela inf_mensal_fii_complemento), publicado como fração e exibido em %.\">     <div class=\"tm-rdm-title\">Rentabilidade mensal</div>     <svg class=\"tm-rd-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 62\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Média 1,30% ao mês · desvio-padrão 0,75 p.p. · 12 meses (out/2025 a set/2026) · último mês 0,76%\"><line class=\"tm-rd-axis\" x1=\"4\" x2=\"216\" y1=\"46\" y2=\"46\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"4.6\" y=\"29.5\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"16.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"75.3\" y=\"37.8\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"8.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"110.6\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"145.9\" y=\"37.8\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"8.2\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"tm-rd-bar\" x=\"181.3\" y=\"13.0\" width=\"34.1\" height=\"33.0\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path class=\"tm-rd-curve\" d=\"M4.0,42.8 L7.6,42.5 L11.2,42.1 L14.8,41.8 L18.4,41.4 L22.0,40.9 L25.6,40.5 L29.2,40.0 L32.7,39.5 L36.3,39.0 L39.9,38.5 L43.5,37.9 L47.1,37.4 L50.7,36.8 L54.3,36.2 L57.9,35.5 L61.5,34.9 L65.1,34.3 L68.7,33.7 L72.3,33.0 L75.9,32.4 L79.5,31.8 L83.1,31.2 L86.6,30.6 L90.2,30.0 L93.8,29.5 L97.4,29.0 L101.0,28.5 L104.6,28.0 L108.2,27.6 L111.8,27.2 L115.4,26.9 L119.0,26.6 L122.6,26.4 L126.2,26.2 L129.8,26.0 L133.4,26.0 L136.9,25.9 L140.5,25.9 L144.1,26.0 L147.7,26.1 L151.3,26.3 L154.9,26.6 L158.5,26.8 L162.1,27.2 L165.7,27.5 L169.3,27.9 L172.9,28.4 L176.5,28.9 L180.1,29.4 L183.7,29.9 L187.3,30.5 L190.8,31.1 L194.4